<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 466 MLN WITH NBP.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 466 MLN WITH NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid for 92 million zlotys of the central bank's 91-day NBP-bills against the 100 million zloty offer and for 374 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against the 400 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
